  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lokamarinyang Irrigation Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Food production (tomatoes, maize, kale, water melon, and cow peas), Beneficiaries: Marginalized farmers, mostly women, Summary: The project funds will be used to sink a borehole, install a drip irrigation system, purchase certified seeds and pesticides, and to expand acreage under production. Funds will also be used to sponsor financial management, monitoring and evaluation, and business management training in order to strengthen the capacity of the group.</narrative>
  </description>
